// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ernesto Hess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1941479167" "Ernesto Hess"
// ProfessionString :
"P264505332" "Council Turncoat"
// DescriptionString :
"P541168366" "Ernesto Hess is a Adjutant in the ranks of the Vortex, one of the Council's Outer Bands. Luckily for Paragon City, he's decided that the Council is far too megalomaniacal for him. As a high-ranking officer, Ernesto is able to get his hands on the  very best information, and so far he seems willing to pass it along to the heroes he meets. If his treachery was discovered by the Council, it would certainly cost him his life."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1021366160" "If you think you can handle it, I can put you onto the biggest action Striga Isle has ever seen. I don't have the whole story yet, but I've learned that the upper echelons of the Council are planning a massive assault on Paragon City. If you're willing to work with me, I think I can help you stop it."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2984632094" "I can't be too careful. If you're not above Security Level 25, I ain't talking. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P299430695" "I can handle the Council. You should be looking for a bigger coup. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P71895485" "I'm not putting my neck on the line unless I know you can get the job done. And you'll need at least five other heroes to do it. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P3023621427" "I talk to your team leader, and that's it."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2783710962" "Get your whole team here, and I'll tell you how it all goes down."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2355291464" "Some members of your team don't meet my requirements. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// DontHaveToken :
"P2619140702" "Explore this island, learn its secrets. Then maybe we'll talk. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You must complete Lars Hansen's story arc in order to unlock this story arc. You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P2413338727" "Task Force Enigma"
// TaskForceName :
"P867314805" "Task Force Puzzle"
// TaskForceName :
"P3207591667" "Task Force Riddle"
// TaskForceName :
"P3337781377" "Task Force Charade"
// TaskForceName :
"P3350928690" "Task Force Paradox"
// HelloString :
"P4202216981" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>It's time we got to work.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3780589380" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is a lot you don't know about.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P233469758" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've heard some things that ought to scare you.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3274550473" "Nuh uh. You want {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3286226580" "For everyone's protection, you'll need a code name. {TaskForceName} should do it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P78879807" "You helped me, and I won't forget that. If the Council tries its old tricks again, I hope you'll be willing to lend a hand."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1274318427" "I got to admit, you're made of sterner stuff than most heroes. You may beat the Council yet! I'd like to know everything that's happening; please call me regularly."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1404292650" "I won't forget your valor, {TaskForceName}. I'll remember each and every one of you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P928494366" "You want me advice? Get off Striga. You're headed for the big leagues now."
// LocationString :
"P2335785254" "Striga Isle"
// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
