// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Long Jack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4057065486" "Long Jack"
// ProfessionString :
"P3212319053" "Longshoreman"
// DescriptionString :
"P3116542964" "Long Jack has worked the docks in Port Noble since he was a petty officer in the Second World War. He was training himself up to be a Natural hero, but that wasn't in the cards. He lost his health - not to an accident or a disease, but to an unethical army doctor who used Jack's body for experimentation at the behest of the Council villain, Maestro. Jack's sad history may be the reason the Council seems to leave him alone these days. Unfortunately for the Council, Jack has no intention of returning the favor."
// HelloString :
"P3312320194" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I got worries.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1018787715" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I need a hand.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P238409080" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You're in for a bumpy ride.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P196935616" "I'm afraid we're not acquainted. You better talk to {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3058484117" "I've known Stephanie Peebles a lot of years, {HeroName}; if she thinks you're a hero, that's good enough for me."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1212012862" "You've helped me more than you know, {HeroName}. Truth is, you helped me come to terms with my past. I won't forget this."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2600538610" "You're up to your eyeballs in work, {HeroName}. Best get cracking."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4100355779" "Things on Striga can get rough. I'd like you to get to Security Level {Level} before we talk about my next job."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3926703420" "Friend, you're all right in my book. Let me see if I can find some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> you could use. You need anything at all, call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3398634383" "You've convinced me, {HeroName}: you're one of the best. I was saving these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> for my own career as a hero, but I guess that ship has sailed. Take a look."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P165798251" "You've moved beyond me, hero. Best of luck out there."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P546086395" "My friend Long Jack would like to get to know you better. He keeps his eye on the docks, and he knows a lot about what's happening with the Council and the Sky Raiders. Long Jack can usually get you Natural and Technology Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2232038290" "Choose Long Jack"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2150561750" "Long Jack won't steer you wrong."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3755686099" "Care to meet a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</a> of mine?"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3235702973" "There are a couple of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> I know who could stand to make your acquaintance."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


