// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Moonfire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P209622569" "Moonfire"
// ProfessionString :
"P972076576" "Peacebringer"
// DescriptionString :
"P2447958068" "The young woman known as Aurelie Damiens used to be a humble French art student, visiting Paragon City as part of an international exchange program. She was bright and enthusiastic, but, in her eyes at least, nothing special. That all changed one day at the Paragon Museum of Art, when she felt the presence of a dying Kheldian touch her mind. Aurelie had a choice: she could allow the energy being to fade away entirely; or she could take it upon herself, merging with it, becoming far more than the sum of her parts. To this day, Aurelie has no regrets about her choice. As a member of the Peacebringer Army, she watches over Striga Isle and the dark forces that shadow it."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P4257634393" "I have been watching this little island for some time, heroes, and I am greatly troubled. I fear that the heinous crimes of the Council (and of those they have allied themselves with) may spell the destruction of this entire planet, its people, and all its glorious mysteries. I must beg you to help me. Perhaps together, we can stand between this Earth and the coming disaster."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1686332728" "I fear Arakhn would destroy you. Come back when you have attained Security Level 23. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 23. If they are over Level 28, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 28 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P1340807273" "I can deal with Striga's worries. You are needed elsewhere. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 23. If they are over Level 28, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 28 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P814971618" "It will take at least six heroes to best Arakhn. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 23. If they are over Level 28, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 28 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P4246509486" "I must address your leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3038816741" "When everyone is here, I will explain what is to pass."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1062770261" "Some members of your team don't meet my requirements. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 23. If they are over Level 28, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 28 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P3212163416" "Task Force Starstuck"
// TaskForceName :
"P2279401094" "Task Force Astral"
// TaskForceName :
"P2707347582" "Task Force Comet"
// TaskForceName :
"P2393295168" "Task Force Nova"
// HelloString :
"P3697872933" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Arakhn must be stopped!</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3238087061" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is more to do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2966301800" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>This world needs your assistance.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P491609098" "I'm sure {LastContactName} could use your help."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3961976578" "A code name seems in order. I like the sound of {TaskForceName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1026192611" "You have done well. If Arakhn's shadow ever darkens this isle again, I hope I can count on your assistance."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1786643936" "{TaskForceName}, I believe Arakhn has met her match! You may consider me your servant; call on me whenever you wish."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1627576355" "You are remarkable heroes. With your help, I shall triumph over Arakhn at last!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1539013529" "Greater challenges await you beyond this little isle."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


