// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Stephanie_Peebles 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Stephanie Peebles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1282195877" "Stephanie Peebles"
// ProfessionString :
"P2597705981" "Tavern Owner"
// DescriptionString :
"P171731079" "Stephanie Peebles was born in the apartment above the Mermaid Tavern, and that's where she's lived her entire life. She's too tough to be pushed around by the local thugs, and she's become sort of a mascot to the rough and ready characters who patronize her tavern. In her heart of hearts, Stephanie has something of a soft spot for the petty thugs who run the docks in Port Noble; after all, they make life interesting. But she draws the line when it comes to the Council. Stephanie's alarmed by the speed with which the Council's troops have overrun her home, and she'd do anything to root them out."
// HelloString :
"P2635840293" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey there, {HeroName}. You up for some action?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P4184146561" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I hope you're tough enough to handle this one.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3635466930" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Get ready, kid. This one's gonna be a doozy.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3497509751" "We're strangers, see? You better look up {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1615379050" "So you're {HeroName}, eh? Well, I've seen plenty of heroes in my day. Here's hoping you're up to snuff."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1454048440" "You cleared me out of missions, kid. Thanks to you, I've got hope for Port Noble again."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3289232262" "You've got plenty to do as it is, hero."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P750411265" "Things are getting hairy around here. Bulk up, get to Security Level {Level}, and we'll talk."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2232597285" "I got to admit, you're something special. Take a look at these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements,</a> friend; I'd sure like to help you out. Call me any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1808300953" "It's been a long time since I trusted anyone the way I trust you. I hope these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> can help you in your journeys."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2194552235" "It's time to leave me behind, {HeroName}; you've got bigger fish to fry."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1298343121" "There's a woman called Stephanie Peebles who lives over on Striga Isle; I know she could sure use your help. She's concerned about the Council's incursion into that zone, and I have to admit: she's right to be. Stephanie has access to Natural and Magic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3917530081" "Choose Stephanie Peebles"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P233882654" "Don't let Stephanie's bluster scare you off. Underneath it all, she's as sweet as a kitten."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4116183935" "There's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> I know who could sure use your help."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2958310962" "Couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>folks</a> I know want to meetcha."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


