// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Tobias Hansen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1730576687" "Tobias Hansen"
// ProfessionString :
"P592751223" "Vicar"
// DescriptionString :
"P3386390622" "Tobias Hansen has been around Striga Island for quite some time, but you wouldn't know it to look at him. According to local legend, 'Old Toby' was already the vicar when the Family started setting up shop here in the 1920's. No one can explain the strange youth of Tobias and his twin brother, Lars, although many suspect it has something to do with the Council's genetic experimentation. One thing is certain: Tobias makes no bones about his desire to shut the Council down, once and for all. So far the Council hasn't struck back at Tobias, but it may be only a matter of time."
// HelloString :
"P630511403" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have work for you.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2066684121" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Are you ready to strike at the  evil that surrounds us?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P343398354" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Evil things are afoot.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4053013805" "I'm afraid I'm quite busy. Perhaps you should speak to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3177606584" "{HeroName}, is it? I hear you've done a lot of good for our little island. I'm grateful, of course, but there is more to be done."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2465177795" "I have no more work for you, my friend. Perhaps your other contacts have something."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2293768427" "You are overworked, young {HeroName}. I will not add to your load."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P781021628" "I have something I'd like you to look into, but it could get dangerous. You should come back when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P493367083" "My friend, you are a wonder. Perhaps these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> will serve you well in your adventures. Please call upon me if you are ever in need."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4254699112" "Truly, you are a godsend. I hope these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> will keep you safe from harm."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1891758166" "You have done everything I could ask of you, {HeroName}. You must move beyond me now, but I will always be your friend."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3841624143" "There's a fellow named Tobias Hansen who you ought to meet. Most folks around here call him 'Old Toby.' He's a little bit older than he looks, see, and he's got a wealth of experience when it comes to dealing with the Council. Toby can get you Science and Mutation Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2348635226" "Choose Tobias Hansen"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1055737093" "Toby knows what he's talking about, {HeroName}. He's been around this island longer than most people care to admit."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P771200014" "It seems there is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>one</a> who could use your assistance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1741452540" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associates</a> of mine could use your help."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

